(a) the number of workers registered on e-Shram Portal, State/UT-wise;
(b) the corresponding details for Odisha, district-wise;
(c) the category-wise details of registered workers in Odisha, including agricultural workers, construction workers, gig and platform workers, migrant workers and other unorganised workers; and
(d) the number of e-Shram registered workers who have been linked with various social security and welfare schemes, State/UT-wise and district-wise in Odisha?

(a) the present status of the development of the four-lane highway corridor connecting Jamujhadi (NH-16) to Dhamra Port in Odisha, including the current stage of implementation;
(b) the total approved length and estimated cost of the project, along with the year-wise details of funds allocated, released and expenditure incurred since its approval;
(c) the present status of land acquisition, statutory clearances and construction works, indicating the physical and financial progress achieved so far; and
(d) the target timeline for completion of the project and the measures being taken by Government to ensure its timely execution and operationalisation for strengthening port connectivity and regional economic development?

(a) the total number of beneficiaries covered under the National Food Security Act (NFSA) and the Pradhan Mantri Garib Kalyan Anna Yojana (PMGKAY) across the country and in the State of Odisha, category-wise and district-wise;
(b) the quantity of foodgrains allocated and distributed under the scheme during the last five years, State-wise;
(c) the amount of food subsidy incurred by Government during the said period; and
(d) the measures taken by Government to further strengthen food security and nutritional support under the scheme?

(a) the year-wise details of domestic production, imports, availability and consumption of urea in the country during the last five years;
(b) the State/UT-wise allocation, supply and consumption of urea during the said period, along with the district-wise details for Odisha;
(c) the year-wise details of subsidy released, production and distribution of neem coated urea and nano urea;
(d) the plant-wise installed capacity and production of domestic urea manufacturing units; and
(e) the measures taken to ensure timely availability of urea and reduce import dependence?

(a) total number of houses sanctioned, grounded, completed and occupied under Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana-Urban (PMAY-U) and PMAY-U 2.0 across the country and in the State of Odisha, State-wise and district-wise in respect of Odisha;
(b) the details of Central assistance sanctioned, released and utilized under the scheme across the country and in Odisha during the last five years;
(c) the number of beneficiaries belonging to Scheduled Castes, Scheduled Tribes, women, senior citizens and differently-abled categories under the scheme, both nationally and in Odisha; and
(d) the steps taken by Government to expedite the completion of pending houses under PMAY-U and PMAY-U 2.0?
